<title>GUINEA: SOCCER-GUINEA BEAT TUNISIA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GUINEA BEAT TUNISIA 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CONAKRY 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinea beat Tunisia 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) in an African Nations Cup group four qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Abdoul Salam Sow 49</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
</text>
